{"text":"purananuru","n":289,"lines":["திணை துறை தெரிந்தில","ஈரச் செவ்வி உதவின ஆயினும்","பல்எருத் துள்ளும் நல் எருது நோக்கி","வீறுவீறு ஆயும் உழவன் போலப்","பீடுபெறு தொல்குடிப் பாடுபல தங்கிய","மூதி லாளர் உள்ளும் காதலின்","தனக்கு முகந்து ஏந்திய பசும்பொன் மண்டை","இவற்கு ஈக என்னும் அதுவும்அன் றிசினே","கேட்டியோ வாழி_பாண பாசறைப்","பூக்கோள் இன்று என்று அறையும்","மடிவாய்த் தண்ணுமை இழிசினன் குரலே"],"tr":["tiṇai tuṟai terintila","īrac cevvi utaviṉa āyiṉum","palerut tuḷḷum nal erutu nōkki","vīṟuvīṟu āyum uḻavaṉ pōlap","pīṭupeṟu tolkuṭip pāṭupala taṅkiya","mūti lāḷar uḷḷum kātaliṉ","taṉakku mukantu ēntiya pacumpoṉ maṇṭai","ivaṟku īka eṉṉum atuvumaṉ ṟiciṉē","kēṭṭiyō vāḻipāṇa pācaṟaip","pūkkōḷ iṉṟu eṉṟu aṟaiyum","maṭivāyt taṇṇumai iḻiciṉaṉ kuralē"],"colophon":{"poet_ta":"கழாத்தலையார்","poet_tr":"Kaḻāttalaiyār"},"scan":{"meter":"āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"11 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"9×4, 1×3, 1×2 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 40, veṇcīr 1"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 23, veṇṭaḷai 17"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"திணைதுறை","tr":"tiṇaituṟai","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"திணை","tr":"tiṇai"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"துறை","tr":"tuṟai"}]},{"text":"தெரிந்தில","tr":"terintila","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"தெரிந்","tr":"terin"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தில","tr":"tila"}]}],[{"text":"வீரச்","tr":"vīrac","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வீ","tr":"vī"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரச்","tr":"rac"}]},{"text":"செவ்வி","tr":"cevvi","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"செவ்","tr":"cev"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வி","tr":"vi"}]},{"text":"யுதவின","tr":"yutaviṉa","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"யுத","tr":"yuta"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"வின","tr":"viṉa"}]},{"text":"வாயினும்","tr":"vāyiṉum","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வா","tr":"vā"},{"kind":"nir